        <item>
            <title>0.14.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 08:39:13 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>428</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Faster: opening a session no longer pauses while LUTs load, and Auto Grade no longer freezes the app.</li>
<li>Faster Gallery: thumbnails appear about 40% sooner.</li>
<li>Cleaner layout: viewer tools sit above the preview, clip actions in the sidebar, and correction actions together in the inspector.</li>
<li>Auto Grade All: grade a whole camera or selection in one go, with one undo.</li>
<li>Original ratio: export each clip in its own shape, and portrait clips now preview the right way up.</li>
<li>New app icon, with a choice of three in Settings.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
